    0 ms  MODE LOITER    refused (needs a position estimate), staying in STABILIZE; asked by: pilot switch
 4000 ms  MODE STABILIZE -> LOITER    reason: pilot switch
 6000 ms  MODE AUTO      refused (no such mode), staying in LOITER; asked by: ground station
 9000 ms  EVENT position estimate lost while in LOITER
 9000 ms  MODE LOITER    -> LAND      reason: failsafe: position lost
 9500 ms  MODE RTL       refused (needs a position estimate), staying in LAND; asked by: pilot switch
